":"quartic.lemma-2","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma 2","locator":"Lemma 2, Section 2","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma 2** (OpenAI ([OpenAI 2026](#cite-OpenAI2026), Lemma 2.1)). *Fix $k\\ge2$. For all sufficiently large powers of four $m$,*\n$$\n L:=\\left\\lfloor m^{1-1/k}/\\ell^2\\right\\rfloor < R(P).\n\\tag{3}\n$$\n*For every $0<\\eta<1/2$ a reversible quantum algorithm with $O_k(1+\\log(1/\\eta))$ queries on every input computes $P$ with error at most $\\eta$ on its domain. There is an exact fan-in-two circuit with $S=O_k(m\\ell^2)$ gates whose two outputs are the domain bit of $P$ and, on the domain, its value.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:64b4bff49f4a37d69616e0b90f4914305cfb20c7c3287b1bc972500c7b211f5d/nodes/quartic.lemma-2","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:64b4bff49f4a37d69616e0b90f4914305cfb20c7c3287b1bc972500c7b211f5d/nodes/quartic.lemma-2","id":"sha256:64b4bff49f4a37d69616e0b90f4914305cfb20c7c3287b1bc972500c7b211f5d/edges/%5B%22quartic.lemma-2%22%2C%22lean.QuarticQuery.Paper.construction_lemma_2_1_complete%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:64b4bff49f4a37d69616e0b90f4914305cfb20c7c3287b1bc972500c7b211f5d/edges/%5B%22quartic.lemma-2%22%2C%22lean.QuarticQuery.Paper.construction_lemma_2_1_complete%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:64b4bff49f4a37d69616e0b90f4914305cfb20c7c3287b1bc972500c7b211f5d/nodes/lean.QuarticQuery.Paper.construction_lemma_2_1_complete"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:64b4bff49f4a37d69616e0b90f4914305cfb20c7c3287b1bc972500c7b211f5d/edges/%5B%22quartic.lemma-2%22%2C%22lean.QuarticQuery.Paper.construction_lemma_2_1_complete%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","id":"field:5b929c2e90051b2280802d289fa00ff3dcab903524a6c29271cf890de2943baf","kind":"from","owner_ref":"sha256:64b4bff49f4a37d69616e0b90f4914305cfb20c7c3287b1bc972500c7b211f5d/edges/%5B%22quartic.lemma-2%22%2C%22lean.QuarticQuery.Paper.const